<view class="page">
  <view class="status-bar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="topbar"><view class="back-hit" bindtap="goBack"><text class="back-icon">‹</text></view><text class="topbar-title">食养安康</text></view>
  <scroll-view class="scroll" scroll-y>
    <view class="section">
      <text class="section-title">菌菇家常搭配与四季养生吃法</text>
      <text class="section-intro">顺应四时变化，用家常做法吃出鲜味与舒适感。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="season-card {{item.theme}}" wx:for="{{seasons}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="season-badge">{{item.key}}</view>
      <view class="season-info">
        <text class="season-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="season-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="back-directory" bindtap="goBack">返回食养目录  ↑</view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
